; Every object of the repository S11 verifies.
;
; A chain is a claim about several artifacts at once, so the whole store is
; named here and pinned by the foundation that uses it. Fifteen of the
; nineteen are reachable from the branch head; the other four are the
; structured contents the tree entries name by their spelling rather than by
; a reference, and a repository holds them too.
